There is one of variants of termcap database.
Variant linlib/visi based on termlib or termnew requires such a file.
Unfortunately, termcap file not found in modern Linux distibutions anymore.

Please, put this file as ~/.termcap or /usr/local/etc/termcap as workaround
in case no termcap database supported on your system.
Note, there is a plan to migrate linlib/visi to terminfo/courses to solve this problem.
